{"id":"2830229fa8f44c6a","group":"57","path":"57/57-thm-birkhoff-variety.md","title":"Birkhoff Theorem","display":"thm-birkhoff-variety — Birkhoff Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-thm-birkhoff-variety","aliases":["57-thm-birkhoff-variety"],"display":"thm-birkhoff-variety — Birkhoff Theorem","depends_on":["[[57-df-structure]]","[[57-df-substructure]]","[[57-df-homomorphism]]","[[57-df-universal-closure]]","[[57-df-indexed-product]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-thm-birkhoff-variety"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-thm-birkhoff-variety</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-birkhoff-variety — Birkhoff Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c136ba3960a7223a\" href=\"?note=c136ba3960a7223a\" title=\"57-df-structure\">57-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"90dc104b21b5c21e\" href=\"?note=90dc104b21b5c21e\" title=\"57-df-substructure\">57-df-substructure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"de2e8913ee05cab6\" href=\"?note=de2e8913ee05cab6\" title=\"57-df-homomorphism\">57-df-homomorphism</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9f84d5a885cb119f\" href=\"?note=9f84d5a885cb119f\" title=\"57-df-universal-closure\">57-df-universal-closure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"730f0de0d5c55c32\" href=\"?note=730f0de0d5c55c32\" title=\"57-df-indexed-product\">57-df-indexed-product</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 为只含常量及有限正元函数符号的一阶字母表，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rel}_S=\\varnothing\">\\(\\mathrm{Rel}_S=\\varnothing\\)</span>，结构载体非空。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal K\">\\(\\mathcal K\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>-结构类；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Hom}\">\\(\\mathrm{Hom}\\)</span>、子结构、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UC}\">\\(\\mathrm{UC}\\)</span> 及集合族直积分别取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"de2e8913ee05cab6\" href=\"?note=de2e8913ee05cab6\" title=\"57-df-homomorphism\">57-df-homomorphism</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"90dc104b21b5c21e\" href=\"?note=90dc104b21b5c21e\" title=\"57-df-substructure\">57-df-substructure</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"9f84d5a885cb119f\" href=\"?note=9f84d5a885cb119f\" title=\"57-df-universal-closure\">57-df-universal-closure</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"730f0de0d5c55c32\" href=\"?note=730f0de0d5c55c32\" title=\"57-df-indexed-product\">57-df-indexed-product</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\mathfrak A_i)_{i\\in I}\">\\((\\mathfrak A_i)_{i\\in I}\\)</span> 为任意集合指标结构族，允许 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I=\\varnothing\">\\(I=\\varnothing\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D=\\prod_{i\\in I}|\\mathfrak A_i|\">\\(D=\\prod_{i\\in I}|\\mathfrak A_i|\\)</span>。下面给出其结构直积解释 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\">\\(J\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\">\\(c\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 遍历各自符号类型，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec a\\in D^n\">\\(\\vec a\\in D^n\\)</span>。类表达式用背景 ZFC 的类模式解释；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal K\\in\\mathrm{Variety}\">\\(\\mathcal K\\in\\mathrm{Variety}\\)</span> 是类参数上的谓词记号，并不声称真类是集合的元素。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> 表示全部集合的背景类，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal K^I\">\\(\\mathcal K^I\\)</span> 表示定义域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span>、各值属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal K\">\\(\\mathcal K\\)</span> 的集合函数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\">\\(J\\)</span> 的定义域正好是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 的非逻辑符号集。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"J(c)\\coloneqq\\{\\langle i,c^{\\mathfrak A_i}\\rangle:i\\in I\\},\\qquad J(f)(a_1,\\ldots,a_n)\\coloneqq\\{\\langle i,f^{\\mathfrak A_i}(a_1(i),\\ldots,a_n(i))\\rangle:i\\in I\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[J(c)\\coloneqq\\{\\langle i,c^{\\mathfrak A_i}\\rangle:i\\in I\\},\\qquad J(f)(a_1,\\ldots,a_n)\\coloneqq\\{\\langle i,f^{\\mathfrak A_i}(a_1(i),\\ldots,a_n(i))\\rangle:i\\in I\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\prod_{i\\in I}\\mathfrak A_i\\coloneqq\\langle D,J\\rangle.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\prod_{i\\in I}\\mathfrak A_i\\coloneqq\\langle D,J\\rangle.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm S(\\mathcal K)\\coloneqq\\{\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_S:\\exists\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathcal K\\;(\\mathfrak B\\subseteq\\mathfrak A)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm S(\\mathcal K)\\coloneqq\\{\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_S:\\exists\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathcal K\\;(\\mathfrak B\\subseteq\\mathfrak A)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm H(\\mathcal K)\\coloneqq\\{\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_S:\\exists\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathcal K\\;\\exists h\\;(\\mathrm{Hom}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B,h)\\land\\operatorname{ran}(h)=|\\mathfrak B|)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm H(\\mathcal K)\\coloneqq\\{\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_S:\\exists\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathcal K\\;\\exists h\\;(\\mathrm{Hom}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B,h)\\land\\operatorname{ran}(h)=|\\mathfrak B|)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm P(\\mathcal K)\\coloneqq\\{\\prod_{i\\in I}\\mathfrak A_i:I\\in V\\land(\\mathfrak A_i)_{i\\in I}\\in\\mathcal K^I\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm P(\\mathcal K)\\coloneqq\\{\\prod_{i\\in I}\\mathfrak A_i:I\\in V\\land(\\mathfrak A_i)_{i\\in I}\\in\\mathcal K^I\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Eq}_S\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm{UC}(s\\doteq t):s,t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Eq}_S\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm{UC}(s\\doteq t):s,t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal K\\in\\mathrm{Variety}\\leftrightarrow\\exists T\\subseteq\\operatorname{Eq}_S\\;[\\mathcal K=\\{\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_S:\\mathfrak A\\models T\\}].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal K\\in\\mathrm{Variety}\\leftrightarrow\\exists T\\subseteq\\operatorname{Eq}_S\\;[\\mathcal K=\\{\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_S:\\mathfrak A\\models T\\}].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal K\\in\\mathrm{Variety}\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm S(\\mathcal K)\\subseteq\\mathcal K\\land\\mathrm H(\\mathcal K)\\subseteq\\mathcal K\\land\\mathrm P(\\mathcal K)\\subseteq\\mathcal K.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal K\\in\\mathrm{Variety}\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm S(\\mathcal K)\\subseteq\\mathcal K\\land\\mathrm H(\\mathcal K)\\subseteq\\mathcal K\\land\\mathrm P(\\mathcal K)\\subseteq\\mathcal K.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure>","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"c136ba3960a7223a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-substructure","status":"resolved","id":"90dc104b21b5c21e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-substructure]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-homomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"de2e8913ee05cab6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-homomorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-universal-closure","status":"resolved","id":"9f84d5a885cb119f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-universal-closure]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-indexed-product","status":"resolved","id":"730f0de0d5c55c32","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-indexed-product]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-homomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"de2e8913ee05cab6","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S$ 为只含常量及有限正元函数符号的一阶字母表，$\\mathrm{Rel}_S=\\varnothing$，结构载体非空。$\\mathcal K$ 为 $S$-结构类；$\\mathrm{Hom}$、子结构、$\\mathrm{UC}$ 及集合族直积分别取 [[57-df-homomorphism]]、[[57-df-substructure]]、[[57-df-un